	"description": "Enterprise-grade Windows productivity, system diagnostics, and server administration toolkit.\nFeatures clean multi-layered navigation (Quick Apps, Terminals, Network, System & Power, Files & Storage),\nreal-time process and socket tracking, and comprehensive accessibility controls.",
